              <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-cyan); margin-top: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;"></span>Cognitive infrastructure, fully built</li>
